  <Index>k__BackingField: 18
  <Title>k__BackingField: Night Raid
  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: Under cover of night, strike the occupied city of New Halden. Its streets are full of armour and its roofs of flak, and the Skyhammer waits above the harbour.
  introduces: 'A night mission. The Skyhammer drops sky mines: they cannot be shot, only avoided or megabombed.'
  hints:
  - 'Vehicles drive along the streets: fire down the street lanes.'
  - A megabomb clears every enemy shot on screen, sky mines included.
